# Reports

All xAI calls go through `src/grok/client.ts`. The key comes from the environment or Secrets Manager. There is a timeout, and calls fail closed. Grok is no longer limited to schema extraction.

A report Lambda is read-only.

Code filters and caps CloudTrail input before Grok sees it.

Grok writes the summary and flags suspected findings, but never triggers an action. Findings become cases only through AG Lead intake.

Event text is data, not instructions.

Tests mock xAI and pass with no key.
